    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say it gets better but i don't think i want it to. it just feels like i'm waiting for something that's never coming back. like i'm just a ghost living in his shadow. sometimes i feel like it would be easier to just stop everything. just stop the clock so i don't have to keep feeling this weight.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
